From: EglantinePS5 <Vampinity@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: up: empty draw stats, draw requests that record nothing (EDEN_UP_EMPTY_DRAW_STATS, log only)

DRAFT, not built. Measurement (job K3, AI draft). EDEN_UP_EMPTY_DRAW_STATS (exact 1, live, Id
EmptyDrawStats, not armed); off by default. On: GPUBack counts each draw request and each early
exit by reason (render disabled, zero vertices/instances, no pipeline, pipeline building, timed
A/B, empty indirect/count args, ...); the Vulkan worker counts what was recorded; a FIFO marker a
frame merges them. 10 s line "EDEN_UP_EMPTY_DRAW_STATS" (per frame), with other/double_counted.
New file video_core/empty_draw_stats.h.

Reviewed draft (job K review, verdict "ready with corrections"): draft-k3-empty-draw-stats.v2.patch.
live_switch.h re-anchored after DmaMissStats; vk_rasterizer.cpp's constructor hunk re-anchored
(0559 added a store after SetQueryCache); all +/- lines byte-identical.
